# Copy this to `Caddyfile` (referenced as-is by docker-compose.yml's
# `caddy` service) and replace api.yourdomain.com with your real,
# DNS-pointed-at-this-host domain. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md for the full
# walkthrough — this file alone is enough for automatic HTTPS via
# Let's Encrypt with zero other configuration.

api.yourdomain.com {
	reverse_proxy api:8000
}
